OL,3,GNEWSAThree charged with murder after   
OL,4,Aman, 27, stabbed                       
OL,6,FThree men have been charged with       
OL,7,Fmurdering a 27-year-old man who was    
OL,8,Fstabbed to death.                      
OL,10,FHe died in Moss Bank in Crumpsall,     
OL,11,FManchester, shortly after 01:30 GMT on 
OL,12,FSaturday.                              
OL,14,FHamza Nadeem, 25, and Hayder Nadeem,   
OL,15,F24, both of Galsworthy Avenue, Cheetham
OL,16,FHill and 26-year-old Brendan Vinter, of
OL,17,FKiwi Street, Salford, have been charged
OL,18,Fover the attack.                       
